textTemplates.text:
Greetings,
A Work Item has been transferred to the PVL Supervisor queue requires attention:

Work Item Number: {!Get_Work_Item.Name}
High Priority: {!var_NewHighPriority}
Assigned to: PVL - Supervisors
Call Center Case: {!Get_Work_Item.Case__r.CaseNumber}

Mahalo

Greetings,
A Work Item has been transferred to the general PVL - Tier 1 queue which requires attention:

Work Item Number: {!Get_New_Work_Item_Record.Name}
High Priority: {!var_NewHighPriority}
Assigned to: PVL - Tier 1
Call Center Case: {!Get_New_Work_Item_Record.Case__r.CaseNumber}
Assigned Board: {!Get_New_Work_Item_Record.Board_Program__r.Name}

Mahalo

Greetings,
A Work Item has been transferred directly to you from {!$User.FirstName} {!$User.LastName}  and requires attention:

Work Item Number: {!Get_Work_Item.Name}
High Priority: {!var_NewHighPriority}
Assigned to: PVL - Supervisors
Call Center Case: {!Get_Work_Item.Case__r.CaseNumber}

Mahalo
